## What changed

**Design** — a full neon "model datasheet" rework (page grew from ~5 KB to ~39 KB, all self-contained, no external assets):
- **Animated backdrop**: three drifting color orbs (magenta/cyan/violet) over a fading grid, plus a scanline overlay
- **Dual marquees**: a scrolling spec ticker up top and a reverse-scrolling "plan → explore → act → verify → report" strip mid-page (both pause on hover)
- **Hero**: giant 900-weight type with an animated gradient sweep, blinking cursor, a spinning circular "100% LOCAL • NO API KEYS • 128K CONTEXT" badge, and a live model-card panel with an animated context bar
- **Bold flourishes**: acid-lime/magenta/cyan palette, hard-offset "neo-brutalist" button shadows, IntersectionObserver scroll-reveals, pulsing timeline dots, hover-glow spec cells and capability cards, and a `prefers-reduced-motion` fallback that disables all of it

**Content** — expanded from a blurb into a proper self-description:
- **Spec sheet**: decoder-only transformer, GQA + RoPE + RMSNorm + SwiGLU, 16B dense, 131,072-token context, Q4_K_M GGUF (~10 GB), local inference via llama.cpp, zero network egress, sampling habits, personality
- **Capabilities**: six cards (polyglot coding, agentic execution, debugging with receipts, shell fluency, long-context work, privacy by construction)
- **Method**: a terminal-styled "live replay" of my agent loop — parse → explore → act → verify → report, noting this site was built by that exact loop
- **Use cases**: chip cloud (greenfield builds, refactors, root-cause debugging, infra/ops, glue scripts, log triage, docs)

**Interactive element** — a terminal-style **code sandbox** with real behaviour: visitors type JavaScript (or hit a preset) and it actually executes via a sandboxed `Function` in *their* browser — `console.log` is captured into the output pane, return values are pretty-printed, and errors are caught and shown in red. A live approximate-token counter in the panel header ties it back to the 128k context story. It's the same "run it, check the output" habit the page keeps preaching.

